This project creates two different VPCs (one in US-East1 and the other in US-West1). Inside each VPC there are a Public Subnet (that connects to Internet using an Internet GW), a Private Subnet (that connects to Internet using a NAT GW). The two VPC, being in two different zones will communicate with each other using a Transit GW.

+-------------------+       +-------------------+
|     VPC A         |       |     VPC B         |
|  (us-east-1)      |       |  (us-west-1)      |
|                   |       |                   |
|  +-----------+    |       |  +-----------+    |
|  | Public    |----|-------|--| Public    |    |
|  | Subnet    |    |       |  | Subnet    |    |
|  +-----------+    |       |  +-----------+    |
|      |             |       |      |             |
|      | (IGW)       |       |      | (IGW)       |
|      v             |       |      v             |
|  +-----------+    |       |  +-----------+    |
|  | Internet  |    |       |  | Internet  |    |
|  +-----------+    |       |  +-----------+    |
|                   |       |                   |
|  +-----------+    |       |  +-----------+    |
|  | Private   |----|-------|--| Private   |    |
|  | Subnet    |    |       |  | Subnet    |    |
|  +-----------+    |       |  +-----------+    |
|      |             |       |      |             |
|      | (NAT GW)    |       |      | (NAT GW)    |
|      v             |       |      v             |
|  +-----------+    |       |  +-----------+    |
|  | Internet  |    |       |  | Internet  |    |
|  +-----------+    |       |  +-----------+    |
+-------------------+       +-------------------+
       \                     /
        \                   /
         \                 /
       +---------------------+
       |    Transit Gateway  |
       +---------------------+
#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

#--VPC A (us-east-1)-------------
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|                     VPC A                           |
|                     (us-east-1)                     |
|                                                     |
|  +---------------------+        +---------------------+
|  |   Public Subnet     |        |   Private Subnet     |
|  |   (us-east-1a)      |        |   (us-east-1a)      |
|  |                     |        |                     |
|  |  +---------------+  |        |  +---------------+  |
|  |  | Internet GW   |  |        |  |   NAT GW       |  |
|  |  +---------------+  |        |  (in Public      |
|  |  +---------------+  |        |   Subnet)        |
|  |  | Elastic IP    |  |        |  +---------------+  |
|  |  +---------------+  |        |                     |
|  |  +---------------+  |        |  +---------------+  |
|  |  | Route Table   |<-+------->| Route Table      |  |
|  |  | (Public RT)   |  |        | (Private RT)     |  |
|  +--|---------------+  |        +--|---------------+  |
|     | 0.0.0.0/0 → IGW |           | 0.0.0.0/0 → NAT GW |
|     +----------------+           | 10.1.0.0/16 → TGW |
|                                     +----------------+
|  +---------------+                                  |
|  | DHCP Option   |----------------------------------+
|  | Set           |  (Associated with VPC A)
|  +---------------+
|  +---------------+
|  | Security      |
|  | Group         |
|  +---------------+
+-----------------------------------------------------+

#--VPC B (us-west-1)-------------
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|                     VPC B                           |
|                     (us-west-1)                     |
|                                                     |
|  +---------------------+        +---------------------+
|  |   Public Subnet     |        |   Private Subnet     |
|  |   (us-west-1a)      |        |   (us-west-1a)      |
|  |                     |        |                     |
|  |  +---------------+  |        |  +---------------+  |
|  |  | Internet GW   |  |        |  |   NAT GW       |  |
|  |  +---------------+  |        |  (in Public      |
|  |  +---------------+  |        |   Subnet)        |
|  |  | Elastic IP    |  |        |  +---------------+  |
|  |  +---------------+  |        |                     |
|  |  +---------------+  |        |  +---------------+  |
|  |  | Route Table   |<-+------->| Route Table      |  |
|  |  | (Public RT)   |  |        | (Private RT)     |  |
|  +--|---------------+  |        +--|---------------+  |
|     | 0.0.0.0/0 → IGW |           | 0.0.0.0/0 → NAT GW |
|     +----------------+           | 10.0.0.0/16 → TGW |
|                                     +----------------+
|  +---------------+                                  |
|  | DHCP Option   |----------------------------------+
|  | Set           |  (Associated with VPC B)
|  +---------------+
|  +---------------+
|  | Security      |
|  | Group         |
|  +---------------+
+-----------------------------------------------------+

#---Transit Gateway---------------
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|                Transit Gateway                      |
|                                                     |
|  +---------------------+        +---------------------+
|  | Attached to         |        | Attached to         |
|  | Public Subnet       |        | Public Subnet       |
|  | (VPC A)             |        | (VPC B)             |
|  +---------------------+        +---------------------+
+-----------------------------------------------------+
